🧪 Level 19 — Scenario-Based Questions

These are very important for senior interviews.

Scenario 1

Your application has:

-Xmx4GB

but Heap usage reaches 3.9 GB.

What happens next?

Scenario 2

Your application is doing:

while(true) {
    list.add(new Employee());
}

What happens?

Scenario 3

You have:

List<Employee> list = new ArrayList<>();

while(true) {
    list.add(new Employee());
}

Why can this cause OOM?

Scenario 4

You have:

Employee employee = new Employee();
employee = null;

Is employee immediately removed from memory?

Scenario 5

Two objects reference each other:

A a = new A();
B b = new B();

a.b = b;
b.a = a;

a = null;
b = null;

Will GC collect them?

Why?

Scenario 6

Your application has frequent:

Full GC
Full GC
Full GC

What would you investigate?

Scenario 7

Application response time suddenly increases from:

100ms → 5 seconds

How would you determine whether GC is responsible?

Scenario 8

Your application throws:

OutOfMemoryError: Java heap space

Give the production troubleshooting steps from beginning to end.

Scenario 9

Your Heap is only 50% used but the application throws:

OutOfMemoryError

How is this possible?

Scenario 10

You increase:

-Xmx4g → -Xmx16g

Will the application necessarily become faster?

Why/why not?

